<title>USA: U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Livestock analysts estimate Monday's hog slaughter from 345,000 to 355,000 head versus 349,000 a week ago and 354,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>Cattle slaughter estimates ranged from 125,000 to 127,000 head, versus 123,000 a week ago and 128,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
